flowchart TD
    Start[Visitor opens page] --> Load{Assets loaded?}
    Load -->|Yes| Render[Render content]
    Load -->|No| Inspect[Inspect network errors and paths]
    Inspect --> Fix[Correct path or hosting configuration]
    Render --> Action{Visitor action}
    Action -->|Navigation| Anchor{Target exists?}
    Anchor -->|Yes| Navigate[Move to section]
    Anchor -->|No| Report[Record broken navigation defect]
    Action -->|Tab| Panel{Target panel exists?}
    Panel -->|Yes| Show[Display panel]
    Panel -->|No| Report
    Action -->|Contact form| Endpoint{Handler exists?}
    Endpoint -->|Current state: no| Warn[No verified submission]
    Endpoint -->|Future state: yes| Service[Handle response and errors]
